-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY NOTES (web source is THE spec)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Hooks: useTranslation only (NO data fetch). Faithful phases reproduced: `.hidden`
  (web visible===false: standalone OR no captured beforeinstallprompt OR dismissed within the
  14-day window -> renders nothing, like AiUsageCard `.gated`, NOT a hidden section), `.available`
  (icon + title + subtitle + Install + Dismiss), `.installing` (transient OS-prompt; CTA progress).
  The generic loading/empty/error/stale/offline template states are N/A for this event-driven,
  non-fetching affordance and are deliberately NOT fabricated (no silent drift).
- i18n: the four EXACT web `t()` keys resolve through the P1/S10 facade with their English
  fallbacks: installPrompt.title / .subtitle / .install / .dismiss. No English literals in code.
- Data via the P1/S8 state-holder seam (InstallPromptSource); the view issues no platform calls.
- Telemetry: `view.opened` (slug "InstallPrompt") emitted once, deferred past the withdrawn gate.
- Accessibility: VoiceOver card label (title. subtitle), per-control labels (Install / "Dismiss
  install prompt"), Dynamic Type (scaling + minimumScaleFactor), Reduce-Motion (spring -> instant).
- Charts/maps: none (per source).

